  m_Name: Potatos
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WILCommunityGame.InformationTipSO
  text: Potatoes are a filling and versatile crop that provides energy, potassium
    and vitamin C. They can be prepared in many different ways, making them a useful
    addition to family meals. Growing potatoes can help communities produce more
    food from their available farming space.
